---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Prose title="Editorial Policy: Independence, Accuracy and Corrections" description="Our editorial standards: no paid rankings, how we choose products, how we handle affiliate links, corrections and updates." h1="Editorial Policy" path="/editorial-policy/">
  <h2>Independence</h2>
  <p>Products are chosen and ranked by our editorial team only. Manufacturers and retailers cannot pay for inclusion, placement or a higher score, and we do not accept sponsored posts dressed up as reviews.</p>
  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>Specs come from manufacturer documentation and are cross-checked. Where a spec is unclear or disputed, we leave it out rather than guess. We do not print prices, because generator and power station prices change daily; every product links to its current price.</p>
  <h2>Honest Language</h2>
  <p>We describe our method accurately. Our verdicts are research-based (see <a href="/how-we-test/">how we score</a>), and we don't present them as lab testing.</p>
  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>If you spot an error, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. We fix factual errors promptly and update the page's "Updated" date when the change is material.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
  <p>Some links earn us a commission. They never influence which products we pick. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
</Prose>
